"text": "<p><strong>Made by hand, made to last.</strong></p><p>NovaCraft is a small studio making ceramics, candles, textiles and jewelry by hand. Every piece in our shop is shaped, poured, woven or strung one at a time, in small batches, by people who care how it turns out.</p><p>We started because we wanted things for our own homes that felt personal: a mug that fits your hand, a candle that smells like a place you love, a basket you keep for years. Factory-made pieces rarely feel that way, so we decided to make them ourselves.</p><p>Today we work with a small circle of makers, and every item is checked, finished and packed by hand before it ships to you.</p>",
